<title>PHILIPPINES: Alsons Cement dividend record date Jan 31.</title>
<headline>Alsons Cement dividend record date Jan 31.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alsons Cement Corp said on Tuesday the record date for its 50 percent stock dividend had been set for January 31.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date will be on January 22, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The dividend was declared last May, but it was only recently approved by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
